  <h2>More Than Just a Factory</h2>
  <p>For mature brands, a factory that just "makes clothes" is no longer enough. You need a <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong> that understands the complexities of <strong>Global Logistics</strong> and <strong>Inventory Management</strong>.</p>
  
  <h3>Mitigating Supply Chain Risk</h3>
  <p>We provide a vertically integrated solution. By controlling the yarn sourcing, fabric knitting, and final garment assembly, we eliminate the "middleman lag." This gives our partners a 15-20% lead time advantage over brands using fragmented suppliers.</p>
  
  <h3>Proactive Inventory Management</h3>
  <p>We work with your data to predict demand spikes. Our warehouse solutions allow you to store greige fabric (raw material) at our facility, enabling us to dye and sew custom collections in as little as 14 days when your best-sellers run low.</p>

  <h3>Seamless Global Logistics</h3>
  <p>Our dedicated <strong>Global Logistics</strong> team handles the paperwork. From CO (Certificate of Origin) to duty-free documentation for specific markets, we ensure your high-volume shipments move through customs without delays, protecting your cash flow and launch dates.</p>
</GuideLayout>
